{
  "slug": "claude-ghost-writer",
  "name": "Claude Ghost Writer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin for writing books. Onboarding, structured drafting, hostile critique, and integration — adapted to 6 genres. Based on the constructive demolition protocol.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **27 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (27): `ask-before-writing` (Structured dialogue to extract and clarify what the author wants to say before writing anything), `chapter` (Guided chapter macro), `character-check` (Optional), `character-interview` (Optional), `check` (Quick installation and setup check), `consistency-check` (Cross-chapter consistency audit), `demolish` (Hostile critical analysis of written text), `demolish-persona` (Runs a demolition of a chapter from the perspective of a specific reader persona), and 19 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-ghost-writer@claude-community` from `simonediroma/claude-ghost-writer`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
